pull_request.body:
External api for modules(only works for editor now).
 - modules: Button, Dialog, Editor, Handle, Popover and Toolbar
 - for #750, #783

How to use external API.

```javascript
// first, init summernote normally
$('.summernote').summernote({height:300});
// call editor.insertText 'hello'
$('.summernote').summernote('editor.insertText', 'hello');
// call editor.undo, If you call external API without module name, editor.{{method}} will called.
$('.summernote').summernote('undo');
```

for more editor methods.
https://github.com/summernote/summernote/blob/feature/external-api/src/js/module/Editor.js#L35
Do not pass $editable for first arguments.

